---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Post 12 (Backtest) figure: Checklist. Inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp12-checklist">
  <div class="atp12-checklist-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 396" role="img" aria-label="A table of seven questions to ask about any backtest, each paired with what a weak answer sounds like: how many versions were tried, when each input was known, which stocks are missing, what a trade costs, which data the model never saw, how long the record is, and what happens in a bad stretch.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Seven questions to ask of any backtest, yours or an AI's</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bảy câu hỏi cho mọi backtest, của bạn hay của AI</tspan></text>
<text x="70" y="54" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Ask</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hỏi</tspan></text>
<text x="470" y="54" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>A weak answer sounds like</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Câu trả lời yếu nghe như</tspan></text>
<rect x="14" y="64" width="872" height="38" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="retry" x={40} y={83} size={22} />
<text x="70" y="88" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>How many versions did you try?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bạn đã thử bao nhiêu phiên bản?</tspan></text>
<text x="470" y="88" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>“Just this one”, with no log of the others</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>“Chỉ bản này”, không có nhật ký các bản khác</tspan></text>
<rect x="14" y="110" width="872" height="38" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="clock" x={40} y={129} size={22} />
<text x="70" y="134" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>When was each input known?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi đầu vào được biết từ lúc nào?</tspan></text>
<text x="470" y="134" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>Signal and trade stamped to the same close</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tín hiệu và lệnh cùng gắn một giá đóng cửa</tspan></text>
<rect x="14" y="156" width="872" height="38" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="users" x={40} y={175} size={22} />
<text x="70" y="180" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Which stocks are missing?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mã nào đã biến mất khỏi dữ liệu?</tspan></text>
<text x="470" y="180" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>Universe taken from today's ticker list</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Universe lấy từ danh sách mã hôm nay</tspan></text>
<rect x="14" y="202" width="872" height="38" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="money" x={40} y={221} size={22} />
<text x="70" y="226" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>What does a trade cost?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi lệnh tốn bao nhiêu?</tspan></text>
<text x="470" y="226" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>Zero fee, every order filled at the close</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Phí bằng 0, mọi lệnh khớp ở giá đóng cửa</tspan></text>
<rect x="14" y="248" width="872" height="38" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="test" x={40} y={267} size={22} />
<text x="70" y="272" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Which data did the model never see?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dữ liệu nào mô hình chưa từng thấy?</tspan></text>
<text x="470" y="272" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>Parameters tuned on the whole sample</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tham số chỉnh trên toàn bộ mẫu</tspan></text>
<rect x="14" y="294" width="872" height="38" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="calendar" x={40} y={313} size={22} />
<text x="70" y="318" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>How long is the record?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hồ sơ dài bao lâu?</tspan></text>
<text x="470" y="318" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>A Sharpe of 1 from one year of days</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sharpe 1 tính từ một năm dữ liệu</tspan></text>
<rect x="14" y="340" width="872" height="38" rx="6" class="box" />
<DiagramIcon name="warning" x={40} y={359} size={22} />
<text x="70" y="364" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>What happens in a bad stretch?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chuyện gì xảy ra lúc xấu?</tspan></text>
<text x="470" y="364" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>Only the average, no drawdown</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ có mức trung bình, không có drawdown</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The seven checks, one per section of this post. An AI-written summary often leaves exactly these answers out.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bảy phép kiểm tra, mỗi cái ứng với một phần của bài. Bản tóm tắt do AI viết thường bỏ đúng những câu trả lời này.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp12-checklist { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp12-checklist-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp12-checklist svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp12-checklist text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp12-checklist .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-checklist .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-checklist .t13 { font-size: 13px; }
  .atp12-checklist .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-checklist .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-checklist .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-checklist .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); }
  .atp12-checklist .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-checklist .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .atp12-checklist .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-checklist .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-checklist .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-checklist .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-checklist .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-checklist .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-checklist .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-checklist .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp12-checklist .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-checklist .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp12-checklist .hole { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp12-checklist figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
